    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p>This device functions as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tractor_Beam\" title=\"Tractor Beam\">Tractor Beam</a>, except that its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> bonus is halved (Rounded down). On a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a>, the ship can choose to push the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappled\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grappled\">Grappled</a> target 10 squares away (Or 1 square in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Scale\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Scale\">Starship Scale</a>).</p>",
